levated at -16.9% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.", "On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably within Buffett\u2019s tolerance at 0.7\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage of 19\u00d7 is fortress-like.", "Management returns a meaningful 8.3% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, which is Buffett\u2019s favourite signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."], "sector_headwinds": [{"text": "Price sits 35% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion Graham demanded has been bid away", "sev": "red", "cat": "valuation", "magnitude": 0.3539617481964644}, {"text": "Operating margins softening -2.6pp YoY \u2014 early warning on the moat", "sev": "amber", "cat": "trend"}, {"text": "Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (100% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it", "sev": "amber", "cat": "insider", "ratio": 0.0}, {"text": "Above-average SGA growth (13% YoY) warrants monitoring", "sev": "amber", "cat": "trend"}, {"text": "Antitrust and platform-regulation risk \u2014 the larger the network effect, the larger the regulatory target on its back, and a single consent decree can reset the moat.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}, {"text": "AI disruption of existing software moats \u2014 incumbents with durable margins face commoditisation as AI-native competitors replicate features at a fraction of the R&D cost.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}, {"text": "Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}], "sector_tailwinds": ["Recent earnings have come in above analyst expectations", "Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 Mr. Mar