2\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.", "Accruals are elevated at -9.7% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.", "On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably within Buffett\u2019s tolerance at 0.8\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage runs at 11.8\u00d7.", "Shareholder yield of 3.8% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and within its sector the business captures 2.0\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."], "sector_headwinds": [{"text": "Operating margins contracting -3.3pp YoY \u2014 competitive pressure is eroding the franchise", "sev": "red", "cat": "trend"}, {"text": "SGA costs surged 123% YoY \u2014 may reflect legal, restructuring, or operational issues", "sev": "red", "cat": "trend"}, {"text": "Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies", "sev": "amber", "cat": "moat"}, {"text": "Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring", "sev": "amber", "cat": "quality"}, {"text": "The commodity cycle \u2014 revenue and free cash flow are ultimately hostage to a price the company does not set, and the long-run energy-transition arc adds a structural overhang.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}, {"text": "ESG-driven capital flight and stranded asset risk \u2014 tightening climate policy and investor mandates raise the cost of capital and risk leaving reserves permanently in the ground.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}, {"text": "Geopolitical supply shocks \u2014 wars, sanctions, and OPEC decisions create volatility that no hedging programme can fully neutralise.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}], "sector_tailwinds": ["Consistently beating estimates by 6% \u2014 management is under-promising and over-deliveri