2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk Graham told investors to avoid entirely", "sev": "red", "cat": "quality"}, {"text": "Price sits 30% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left", "sev": "amber", "cat": "valuation", "magnitude": 0.29848693324672737}, {"text": "Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $52.2M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake", "sev": "amber", "cat": "insider"}, {"text": "Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and Buffett warns the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}, {"text": "Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}, {"text": "Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}], "sector_tailwinds": ["Recent earnings have come in above analyst expectations", "Operating margins 9% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power", "Returns on capital have been remarkably steady for 5 years \u2014 the durability Munger calls the real test of a moat", "Piotroski score 9/9 \u2014 financials improving across profitability, leverage and efficiency", "Founder-led \u2014 the alignment Buffett and Munger repeatedly say matters more than any incentive plan", "14 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 the operating record Graham looked for before any dividend claim could be trusted", "Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment", "Analysts see meaningful upside (24%) to their mean target", "Strong Buy consensus from a broad analyst coverage base", "Broad market in a strong uptrend, trading well above its 200-day average"], 