irmed by 1 other valuation measure)", "sev": "amber", "cat": "valuation", "magnitude": 0.6435123799215261}, {"text": "Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies", "sev": "amber", "cat": "moat"}, {"text": "Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business", "sev": "amber", "cat": "quality"}, {"text": "Elevated short interest (12.2% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way", "sev": "amber", "cat": "sentiment"}, {"text": "Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $7.2M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake", "sev": "amber", "cat": "insider"}, {"text": "Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}], "sector_tailwinds": ["Founder-led \u2014 the alignment Buffett and Munger repeatedly say matters more than any incentive plan", "Growing faster than most Financial Services peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool", "Among the least levered in Financial Services \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set", "Broad market in a strong uptrend, trading well above its 200-day average", "Macro indicators collectively point to economic expansion"], "news_headlines": [{"title": "Coinbase Expands USDC Loans to UK After Strong US Demand", "source": "news.bitcoin.com", "link": "https://news.bitcoin.com/coinbase-expands-usdc-loans-to-uk-after-strong-us-demand/", "date": "2026-04-20", "timestamp": 1776704709.0, "origin": "tiingo", "sentiment": null}, {"title": "John Oliver Joins Prediction Market Backlash: What The Takedown Means For Kalshi, Robinhood, Polymarket", "source": "benzinga.com", "link": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/prediction-markets/26/04/51919199/john-oliver-joins-prediction-market-backlash-what-the-takedown-means-for-kalshi-robinhood-polymarket", "date": "2026-04-20", "timestamp": 177670