ds, spices and herbs, condiments, coating systems, and compound flavors to multinational food manufacturers and foodservice customers. It serves foodservice customers directly and indirectly through distributors. The company was founded in 1889 and is headquartered in Hunt Valley, Maryland.", "ceo_bio": "Mr. Brendan M. Foley | President, CEO & Chairman | Age 59 | Compensation: $2.2M (FY2025)", "founder_led": false, "fcf": 740400000.0, "fcf_margin": 0.10824086662865663, "sbc_pct_rev": 0.006754089732906451, "mcap": 14208362496, "roic_by_year": {"2025": 0.08748276257837174, "2024": 0.08848809201744566, "2023": 0.08438576688637159, "2022": 0.07517449046679281}, "roic_cv": 0.07227162725545845, "gross_margin": 0.37729332850193964, "er": 0.08032395, "re_method": "capm", "beta_raw": 0.3286907128723438, "beta_adjusted": 0.5524604752482292, "beta_r2": 0.054449086436506595, "beta_se": 0.03871082521317427, "beta_n_obs": 1254, "beta_r2_class": "unreliable", "dcf_sens_range": [42.99846798547232, 83.7032602499973], "fcf_growth": 0.08, "pfcf": 19.190116823338737, "pb": 2.0345702, "num_analysts": 13, "target_mean": 62.69231, "target_high": 77.0, "target_low": 52.0, "cash_conv": 1.218900430706866, "accruals": -0.013090512408714887, "rev_cagr": 0.02507523864563521, "rev_cagr_5y": 0.040775986020144206, "rev_cagr_10y": 0.047606187839161374, "int_cov": 5.565239551478084, "nd_ebitda": 3.0744407496977026, "de": 1.295615793602371, "cr": 0.6982234994448436, "roe": 0.13761004096574567, "roa": 0.0598012181449047, "shares_out": 253986983, "float_shares": 265314850, "insider_pct": 0.00018999999, "inst_pct": 0.94188005, "shares_short": 727, "short_ratio": 0.0, "short_pct_float": null, "share_turnover_rate": 0.01805179913491866, "share_buyback_rate": 0.0024492618350493976, "shareholder_yield": 0.0364433269594419, "div_yield": 0.03632923368022706, "payout_ratio": 0.3, "insider_buy_ratio": 1.0, "insider_buy_count_90d": 1, "insider_sell_count_90d": 0, "insider_buy_count_365d": 1, "insider_sell_count_