ative competitors replicate features at a fraction of the R&D cost.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}, {"text": "Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.", "sev": "amber", "cat": "thesis_risk"}], "sector_tailwinds": ["Reinvestment rate supports 21% organic growth capacity \u2014 capital is compounding inside the business", "Consistently beating estimates by 16% \u2014 management is under-promising and over-delivering", "Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet by Graham\u2019s test", "22 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 the operating record Graham looked for before any dividend claim could be trusted", "Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment", "Growing faster than most Technology peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool", "Technology sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter", "Technology ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average", "Broad market in a strong uptrend, trading well above its 200-day average", "Macro indicators collectively point to economic expansion"], "news_headlines": [{"title": "2 S&P 500 Stocks Worth Investigating and 1 We Turn Down", "source": "stockstory.org", "link": "https://stockstory.org/us/stocks/nasdaq/adsk/news/buy-or-sell/2-sandp-500-stocks-worth-investigating-and-1-we-turn-down", "date": "2026-04-20", "timestamp": 1776659666.0, "origin": "tiingo", "sentiment": null}, {"title": "Wealth Enhancement Trust Services Inc. Buys New Shares in Amphenol Corporation $APH", "source": "thelincolnianonline.com", "link": "https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/04/19/wealth-enhancement-trust-services-inc-buys-new-shares-in-amphenol-corporation-aph.html", "date": "2026-04-19", "timestamp": 1776599443.0, "origin": "tiingo", "sentiment": null}, {"title": "Assessing Amphenol (APH) Valuation After Conflic