ale and pricing power compound.", "concentration": "HHI of 0.082 flags the sector as competitive with the top 4 capturing 51% of revenue \u2014 fragmentation keeps pricing honest and makes the pool hard to defend; margin discipline matters more than scale.", "key_players": [{"ticker": "LLY", "company_name": "Eli Lilly and Company", "role": "leader", "role_label": "Profit Leader", "note": "Captures 10% of the sector's operating income \u2014 the center of gravity for the profit pool.", "rating": "HOLD", "profit_share": 0.10295208195953673, "revenue_share": 0.021928617372868137, "op_margin": 0.45560686724251676, "pp_multiple": 4.694873379792626}, {"ticker": "JNJ", "company_name": "Johnson & Johnson", "role": "runnerup", "role_label": "Runner-Up", "note": "Holds 9% of sector profits, the clear number-two position.", "rating": "LEAN BUY", "profit_share": 0.08873792732476772, "revenue_share": 0.0316899961061472, "op_margin": 0.27173993821196907, "pp_multiple": 2.8001873849253776}, {"ticker": "MRNA", "company_name": "Moderna, Inc.", "role": "laggard", "role_label": "Margin Laggard", "note": "Operates at -159.9% \u2014 well below the sector's 9.6% blended margin, hinting at a structural disadvantage or a turnaround still in progress.", "rating": "PASS", "profit_share": 0.0, "revenue_share": 0.0006466316235390626, "op_margin": -1.599375650364204, "pp_multiple": null}, {"ticker": "MRK", "company_name": "Merck & Company, Inc.", "role": "notable", "role_label": "Notable Player", "note": "Holds 8% of sector profits.", "rating": "LEAN BUY", "profit_share": 0.0766420284172777, "revenue_share": 0.02187209598225702, "op_margin": 0.340050145360016, "pp_multiple": 3.504100772027102}], "cr4_companies": [{"ticker": "UNH", "company_name": "UnitedHealth Group Incorporated", "revenue_share": 0.15057803114074275, "op_margin": 0.04237130977038075, "rating": "HOLD", "note": "Largest player by revenue (15% of sector); margin trails sector median by 14.0pp; under-earns its size (0.44x profit-t